      "text": "Fournier’s Archiv studio cycle remains the mid-century modern statement for these suites: French-school lyricism on a modern cello, rubato tightly reined, eloquence without pedantry. It is not Bylsma’s baroque world, nor Casals’s championship urgency. Among modern-instrument readings, this is the Référence.",
